msgstr ""
"Como configurar o imposto para :ref:`substituir <taxes/tax-mapping>` outros "
"impostos de acordo com as :doc:`posições fiscais <taxes/fiscal_positions>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:187
msgid ""
"To open a tax's configuration, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
