msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Argentina Payment Withholdings` "
"(`l10n_ar_withholding`) module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:718
msgid ""
"The Argentinian fiscal localization module contains the necessary "
"withholding records, which can be seen by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes` and removing the "
"default :guilabel:`Sale or Purchase` filter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:722
msgid ""
"Journal entries are *not* created when payments are posted "
"unless :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/journals/outstanding-"
"accounts>` are set up. Thus, for this feature to work properly, it is "
"important to verify that *all* payment methods within the bank journals have "
"an outstanding payment and receipt account set."
msgstr ""
"Lançamentos contábeis *não* são criados quando os pagamentos são lançados, a "
"menos que as :ref:`contas de compensação <accounting/journals/outstanding-"
"accounts>` estejam configuradas. Portanto, para que este recurso funcione "
"corretamente, é importante verificar se *todos* os métodos de pagamento nos "
"diários bancários têm uma conta de pagamento e recebimento pendente "
"configurada."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:None
msgid "An outstanding payment account must be set."
msgstr "Uma conta de pagamento pendente deve ser configurada."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:730
msgid ""
"This configuration is crucial for the proper accounting of withholding "
"transactions with clients and vendors."
msgstr ""
"Esta configuração é crucial para a contabilização adequada das transações de "
"retenção com clientes e fornecedores."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:734
msgid ""
"In Argentina, withholdings represent the cancellation of a specific portion "
"of the total debt owed to a supplier or a reduction in the total payment to "
"be collected from a customer. Therefore, one or multiple withholdings can be "
"recorded for each payment applied to an invoice."
msgstr ""
"Na Argentina, as retenções representam o cancelamento de uma porção "
"específica da dívida total devida a um fornecedor ou uma redução no "
"pagamento total a ser recebido de um cliente. Portanto, uma ou múltiplas "
"retenções podem ser registradas para cada pagamento aplicado a uma fatura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:743
msgid ""
"While Odoo already creates most of the required withholdings inside "
"the :guilabel:`Taxes` menu, in several cases it is necessary to apply or "
"modify configurations to correctly calculate the withholding amount on "
"vendor payments. The following withholding types are available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:747
msgid ":ref:`Earnings <localizations/argentina/earnings-withholdings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:748
msgid ""
":ref:`Earnings Scale <localizations/argentina/earnings-scale-withholdings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:749
msgid ""
":ref:`IIBB Total Amount <localizations/argentina/iib-total-amount-"
"withholdings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:750
msgid ""
":ref:`IIBB Non-Taxable <localizations/argentina/iib-nontax-withholdings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:755
msgid "Earnings"
msgstr "Ganhos"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:757
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Earnings` withholdings, Odoo already has a record for each "
"regime group, which is listed under the tax name and the |ARCA| code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:760
msgid ""
"Each of these records is ready to be used. As a best practice, the "
"configuration should be double-checked to make sure it is updated and well-"
"applied. The fields to validate are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:763
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: This is the percentage of the total payment amount which "
"is withheld."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valor`: Esta é a porcentagem do valor total do pagamento que é "
"retida."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:764
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Non-Taxable Amount`: Up to this amount, the withholding does not "
"apply."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valor Não Tributável`: Até este valor, a retenção não se aplica."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:765
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimum Withholding`: If the calculated withholding amount is "
"smaller than this value, the total withholding amount is set to `0.0`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retenção Mínima`: Se o valor da retenção calculado for menor que "
"este valor, o valor total da retenção é definido como `0.0`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:767
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Sequence`: This field automates the capture of a "
"withholding number under the payment line. If this field is not set, a "
"number is manually captured while adding a withholding to a payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:None
msgid "Earnings withholding type."
msgstr "Tipo de retenção de rendimentos."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:777
msgid "Earnings Scale"
msgstr "Escala de Rendimentos"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:779
msgid ""
"In this particular case, a percentage does not need to be set. Instead, this "
"withholding is calculated based on the value of the :guilabel:`Scale` field."
msgstr ""
"Neste caso específico, não é necessário definir uma porcentagem. Em vez "
"disso, esta retenção é calculada com base no valor do "
"campo :guilabel:`Escala`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:782
msgid ""
"To view, modify, or create new scales, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Earnings Scale`. By "
"default, the Argentinian localization is preconfigured with two main scales. "
"However, scales should be created and updated as necessary to suit a "
"business's needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:787
msgid ""
"Earnings scales are cumulative, which means that Odoo keeps track of the "
"different records created for a bill and automatically calculates the "
"correct withholding amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:793
msgid "IIBB Total Amount"
msgstr "Valor Total IIBB"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:795
msgid ""
"In this case, the necessary records related to the applicable province must "
"be created. The withholding amount is calculated based on the "
"percentage :guilabel:`Amount` set on the tax configuration. Since Odoo does "
"not automatically synchronize the percentages applicable to each province, "
"this information must be manually updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:800
msgid ""
"The recommendation, in this case, is to always duplicate and apply the "
"different configurations to each record to safeguard technical "
"configurations that allow the proper calculation and accounting of the "
"withholding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:807
msgid "IIBB Untaxed"
msgstr "IIBB Não Tributado"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:809
msgid ""
"The configuration of non-taxable gross income withholdings is very similar "
"to that of a :ref:`total amount withholding <localizations/argentina/iib-"
"total-amount-withholdings>`, so the percentage :guilabel:`Amount` in each "
"record must be maintained. However, Odoo comes preconfigured with several "
"records that apply to different provinces. The difference, in this case, is "
"that it is not necessary to establish a non-taxable amount or minimum "
"withholding for this record type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:818
msgid "Partner withholding assignation"
msgstr "Atribuição de retenção do parceiro"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:820
msgid ""
"Once the proper configuration is set on each possible withholding for "
"partners, the applicable withholdings must be assigned to each contact. To "
"do this, open the Contacts app and select the desired partner. In "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, find the :guilabel:`Purchase Withholdings` "
"table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:825
msgid ""
"By using the additional fields :guilabel:`From Date` and :guilabel:`To "
"Date`, the applicability of multiple withholdings can be automated across "
"different date ranges. The :guilabel:`ref` field allows you to apply an "
"internal control number to each withholding line, which is just for internal "
"reference, so it does not affect any transactions and is not visible on "
"them. These fields are accessible from the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(adjust settings)` menu."
msgstr ""
"Ao usar os campos adicionais :guilabel:`Data Inicial` e :guilabel:`Data "
"Final`, a aplicabilidade de múltiplas retenções pode ser automatizada em "
"diferentes intervalos de datas. O campo :guilabel:`ref` permite aplicar um "
"número de controle interno a cada linha de retenção, que é apenas para "
"referência interna, portanto não afeta nenhuma transação e não é visível "
"nelas. Esses campos são acessíveis pelo menu :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(ajustar configurações)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:831
msgid ":guilabel:`From Date`: The start of the withholding date range."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:832
msgid ":guilabel:`To Date`: The end of the withholding date range."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:833
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ref`: Apply an internal control number to each withholding line "
"that is only visible for internal reference and does not affect any "
"transactions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:839
msgid "Automatic withholding calculation and application per payment"
msgstr "Cálculo e aplicação automática de retenção por pagamento"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:841
msgid ""
"By applying new payments to vendor bills, Odoo automatically applies and "
"calculates the proper withholding into the payment. Based on the record's "
"configuration, it may be necessary to use a reference number for each "
"withholding line."
msgstr ""
"Ao aplicar novos pagamentos a contas de fornecedores, o Odoo automaticamente "
"aplica e calcula a retenção adequada no pagamento. Com base na configuração "
"do registro, pode ser necessário usar um número de referência para cada "
"linha de retenção."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:845
msgid ""
"More withholdings can be added, or computed withholdings can be edited if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"Mais retenções podem ser adicionadas, ou retenções calculadas podem ser "
"editadas se necessário."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:None
msgid "Payment with applied withholdings."
msgstr "Pagamento com retenções aplicadas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:851
msgid ""
"The amount of the debt to be cancelled equals the total payment amount. "
"However, Odoo still captures the net amount (i.e., the amount to be "
"reconciled with the bank), which will be represented as the payment amount "
"after the withholding application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:0
msgid "Payment registered form."
msgstr "Formulário de pagamento registrado."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:861
msgid "Check management"
msgstr "Gerenciamento de cheques"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:864
msgid ""
"Make sure to :ref:`install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Third Party and "
"Deferred/Electronic Checks Management` (`l10n_latam_check`) module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:867
msgid ""
"This module enables the required configuration for journals and payments to:"
msgstr ""
"Este módulo habilita a configuração necessária para diários e pagamentos "
"para:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:869
msgid "Create, manage, and control your different types of checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:870
msgid "Optimize the management of *own checks* and *third-party checks*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:871
msgid ""
"Have an easy and effective way to manage expiration dates for your own and "
"third-party checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:873
msgid ""
"Once all the configurations are set for the Argentinian electronic invoice "
"flow, it is also needed to complete certain configurations for the own "
"checks and third-party checks flows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:879
msgid "Own checks"
msgstr "Cheques próprios"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:881
msgid ""
"Configure the bank journal used to create your own checks by going "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`, selecting the "
"bank journal, and opening the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab."
msgstr ""
"Configure o diário bancário usado para criar seus cheques próprios "
"acessando :menuselection:`Financeiro --> Configuração --> Diários`, "
"selecionando o diário bancário e abrindo a aba :guilabel:`Pagamentos de "
"Saída`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:885
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Checks` should be available as a :guilabel:`Payment Method`. If "
"not, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and type `Checks` under :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method` to add them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:887
msgid "Enable the :guilabel:`Use electronic and deferred checks` setting."
msgstr "Ative a configuração :guilabel:`Usar cheques eletrônicos e diferidos`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:890
msgid "This last configuration disables the printing ability but:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:892
msgid "allows check numbers to be entered manually"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:893
msgid "adds a field to indicate the payment date of the check"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:898
msgid "Management of own checks"
msgstr "Gestão de cheques próprios"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:900
msgid ""
"Own checks can be created directly from the vendor bill. For this process, "
"click :guilabel:`Register Payment`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:903
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pay` window, select the bank journal from which the "
"payment is to be made and set the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` "
"and :guilabel:`Amount`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:907
msgid ""
"To manage current checks, the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` field must be "
"left blank or filled in with the current date. To manage deferred checks, "
"the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` must be set in the future."
msgstr ""
"Para gerenciar cheques atuais, o campo :guilabel:`Data de Depósito do "
"Cheque` deve ser deixado em branco ou preenchido com a data atual. Para "
"gerenciar cheques pré-datados, a :guilabel:`Data de Depósito do Cheque` deve "
"ser definida no futuro."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:911
msgid ""
"To manage your existing own checks, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --"
"> Vendors --> Own Checks`. This window displays critical information, "
"including the dates checks must be paid, the total number of checks, and the "
"total amount paid in checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:915
msgid ""
"It is important to note that the list is pre-filtered by checks that are "
"still *not reconciled* with a bank statement - that were not yet debited "
"from the bank - which can be verified with the :guilabel:`Is Matched with a "
"Bank Statement` field. If you want to see all of your own checks, delete "
"the :guilabel:`No Bank Matching` filter by clicking on the :guilabel:`X` "
"symbol."
msgstr ""
"É importante notar que a lista é pré-filtrada por cheques que ainda *não "
"estão reconciliados* com um extrato bancário - que ainda não foram debitados "
"do banco - o que pode ser verificado com o campo :guilabel:`Está Conciliado "
"com um Extrato Bancário`. Se você quiser ver todos os seus cheques próprios, "
"exclua o filtro :guilabel:`Sem Conciliação Bancária` clicando no "
"símbolo :guilabel:`X`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:923
msgid "Cancel an own check"
msgstr "Cancelar um cheque próprio"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:925
msgid ""
"To cancel an own check created in Odoo, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Own Checks` and select the "
"check to be cancelled, then click :guilabel:`Void Check`. This breaks the "
"reconciliation between vendor bills and bank statements, leaving the check "
"marked as :guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:933
msgid "Third-party checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:935
