#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:974
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Cash` as :guilabel:`Type`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`Dinheiro` como :guilabel:`Tipo`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:975
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, set :guilabel:`Cash Account`: to "
"`1.1.1.01.002 Rejected Third Party Checks`, input a :guilabel:`Short Code` "
"of your choice, and select a :guilabel:`Currency`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:979
msgid "Use the same payment methods as the *Third-Party Checks* journal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:984
msgid "New third-party checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:986
msgid ""
"To register a *new* third-party check for a customer invoice, "
"click :guilabel:`Register Payment`. In the pop-up window, "
"select :guilabel:`Third-Party Checks` as the journal for the payment "
"registration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:990
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`New Third Party Checks` as :guilabel:`Payment Method`, and "
"fill in the :guilabel:`Check Number`, :guilabel:`Payment Date`, "
"and :guilabel:`Check Bank`. Optionally, you can manually add "
"the :guilabel:`Check Issuer Vat`, but this field is automatically filled "
"with the customer's VAT number as it appears on the invoice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:998
msgid "Existing third-party checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1000
msgid ""
"To pay a vendor bill with an *existing* check, click :guilabel:`Register "
"Payment`. In the pop-up window, select :guilabel:`Third Party Checks` as the "
"journal for the payment registration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1003
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Existing Third Party Checks` as :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method`, and select a check from the :guilabel:`Check` field. The field "
"shows all **available existing checks** to be used as payment for vendor "
"bills."
msgstr ""
"Selecione :guilabel:`Cheques de Terceiros Existentes` como :guilabel:`Método "
"de Pagamento`, e selecione um cheque no campo :guilabel:`Cheque`. O campo "
"mostra todos os **cheques existentes disponíveis** para serem usados como "
"pagamento de faturas de fornecedores."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1007
msgid ""
"When an **existing third-party check** is used, you can review the "
"operations related to it. For example, you can see if a third-party check "
"made to pay a customer invoice was later used as an existing third-party "
"check to pay a vendor bill."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1011
msgid ""
"To do so, either go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Third "
"Party Checks` or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Own Checks`, "
"depending on the case, and click on a check. In the :guilabel:`Check Current "
"Journal` field, click on :guilabel:`=> Check Operations` to bring up the "
"check's history and movements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1016
msgid ""
"The menu also displays critical information related to these operations, "
"such as:"
msgstr ""
"O menu também exibe informações críticas relacionadas a essas operações, "
