#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:900
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`EDI VAT` window, make sure a valid VAT :guilabel:`ROF` "
"(Référence d’Obligation Fiscale) is entered."
msgstr ""
