#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:973
msgid "Odoo certification"
msgstr "Certificação Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:975
msgid ""
"The tax administration requires all companies to provide a certificate of "
"conformity confirming that their software complies with anti-fraud "
"legislation. In case of non-compliance, a €7,500 fine may be imposed."
msgstr ""
"A administração tributária exige que todas as empresas forneçam um "
"certificado de conformidade confirmando que seu software está em "
"conformidade com a legislação antifraude. Em caso de não conformidade, uma "
"multa de € 7.500 pode ser aplicada."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:980
msgid ""
"This `certificate <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-certification/>`_ "
"is granted by Odoo SA to Odoo Enterprise users with a subscription number."
msgstr ""
"Este `certificado <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-certification/>`_ "
"é concedido pela Odoo SA aos usuários do Odoo Enterprise com um número de "
"assinatura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:983
msgid "To get the certification, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para obter a certificação, siga estes passos:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:985
msgid ""
":doc:`Install </applications/general/apps_modules>` the :guilabel:`France - "
"VAT Anti-Fraud Certification for Point of Sale (CGI 286 I-3 bis)` "
"(`l10n_fr_pos_cert`) module."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Instale </applications/general/apps_modules>` o "
"módulo :guilabel:`França - Certificação Antifraude de IVA para Ponto de "
"Venda (CGI 286 I-3 bis)` (`l10n_fr_pos_cert`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:987
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Country` field on the :doc:`company record </applications/"
"general/companies>` to encrypt entries for the inalterability check."
msgstr ""
"Defina o campo :guilabel:`País` no :doc:`registro da empresa </applications/"
"general/companies>` para criptografar entradas para a verificação de "
"inalterabilidade."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:989
msgid ""
"Download the mandatory `certificate of conformity <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"contract/french-certification/>`_ delivered by Odoo SA."
msgstr ""
"Baixe o `certificado de conformidade obrigatório <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"contract/french-certification/>`_ fornecido pela Odoo SA."

