"credenciais para :ref:`configurar seu aplicativo Odoo Financeiro <india/e-"
"waybill-configuration>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:280
msgid ""
"Log in to the `NIC E-Way bill portal <https://ewaybillgst.gov.in/>`_ by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Login` and entering your :guilabel:`Username` "
"and :guilabel:`Password`;"
msgstr ""
"Faça login no `portal NIC E-Way bill <https://ewaybillgst.gov.in/>`_ "
"clicando em :guilabel:`Login` e inserindo seu :guilabel:`Nome de usuário` "
"e :guilabel:`Senha`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:282
msgid "From your dashboard, go to :menuselection:`Registration --> For GSP`;"
msgstr "No seu painel, vá para :menuselection:`Registro --> Para GSP`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:283
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send OTP`. Once you have received the code on your "
"registered mobile number, enter it and click :guilabel:`Verify OTP`;"
msgstr ""
"Clique em :guilabel:`Enviar OTP`. Assim que receber o código no seu número "
"de celular registrado, insira-o e clique em :guilabel:`Verificar OTP`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:285
