"Para habilitar o serviço de nota fiscal eletrônica E-Way no "
"Odoo, :ref:`ative <india/indian-configuration>` o recurso :guilabel:`E-Way "
"bill` e insira o :guilabel:`Nome de usuário` e a :guilabel:`Senha`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:318
msgid "Generate E-Way bill"
msgstr "Gerar nota fiscal eletrônica E-Way"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:320
msgid ""
"To generate an E-Way bill, confirm the customer invoice/vendor bill and "
"click :guilabel:`Create e-Waybill`. Enter the necessary details and "
"click :guilabel:`Generate e-Waybill` to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Para gerar uma nota fiscal eletrônica E-Way, confirme a fatura do cliente/"
