"developers.ecpay.com.tw/?p=24174>`_ fornecidas pela ECPay."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:146
msgid "Send invoices to ECPay"
msgstr "Enviar faturas para a ECPay"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:151
msgid "B2C invoice (individual)"
msgstr "Fatura B2C (pessoa física)"

