":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: uma estrutura "
"predefinida adaptada aos padrões contábeis turcos"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:75
msgid ""
":ref:`localizations/turkiye/taxes`: pre-configured tax rates, including "
"standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/turkiye/taxes`: alíquotas de impostos pré-configuradas, "
