#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:86
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>`, accounts are automatically mapped to their "
"corresponding taxes and default accounts payable and accounts receivable "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"No :doc:`plano de contas <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>`, as "
"contas são automaticamente mapeadas para seus impostos correspondentes e "
"campos padrão de contas a pagar e contas a receber."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:91
msgid ""
"The Türkiye chart of accounts is based on the Turkish Revenue "
"Administration's (Gelir İdaresi Başkanlığı's (GİB)) 7/A accounts, which "
"provide a baseline of the necessary accounts. 7/B accounts are archived and "
"can be unarchived if required."
