#~ msgid ""
#~ "Budgetary positions are lists of accounts for which you want to keep "
#~ "budgets (typically expense or income accounts). They need to be defined "
#~ "so Odoo can know it which accounts he needs to go get the budget "
#~ "information."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "As posições orçamentárias são listas de contas para as quais você deseja "
#~ "manter orçamentos (normalmente contas de despesas ou receitas). Eles "
#~ "precisam ser definidos para que Odoo possa saber quais contas ele precisa "
#~ "para obter as informações de orçamento."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The budgetary positions act as a type of restriction on what can be "
#~ "recorded in the 'practical amount' column in a budget."
